WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:10.364
Guess what! We're going to Disneyland!

2
00:00:10.365 --> 00:00:15.659
But first, we have to buy a few things.

3
00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:19.459
Mom: Kids, would you like to go to Disneyland?

4
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:23.786
Hana & Bada: Disneyland! Yeah! Yeah!

5
00:00:23.787 --> 00:00:28.561
Mom: But first, we have to get some things.

6
00:00:28.562 --> 00:00:32.139
Bada: When are we going to Disneyland, Mom?

7
00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:34.834
Mom: We leave early tomorrow morning.

8
00:00:34.835 --> 00:00:37.065
Hana: How are we getting there?

9
00:00:37.066 --> 00:00:40.168
Mom: We're driving.

10
00:00:40.169 --> 00:00:42.027
Mom: We need some sugar.

11
00:00:42.028 --> 00:00:43.711
Where is it?

12
00:00:43.712 --> 00:00:45.840
Bada: Is this it, Mom?

13
00:00:45.841 --> 00:00:48.519
Mom: No, Bada. That's flour.

14
00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:51.805
Hana: I'll go and ask.

15
00:00:51.806 --> 00:00:55.719
Hana: Excuse me, where is the sugar?

16
00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:57.947
Clerk: Sugar? Follow me.

17
00:00:57.948 --> 00:00:59.184
Here you go.

18
00:00:59.185 --> 00:01:06.073
Hana: Thank you. Oh! Where is everybody?

19
00:01:06.074 --> 00:01:08.593
Hana: Cereals and pasta?

20
00:01:08.594 --> 00:01:11.768
No, I don't see them.

21
00:01:11.769 --> 00:01:13.957
Hana: Drinks and snacks?

22
00:01:13.958 --> 00:01:16.958
Hana: Oh, where can they be?

23
00:01:16.959 --> 00:01:23.396
Hana: Mom? Bada? I think I'm lost.

24
00:01:23.397 --> 00:01:24.929
Clerk: What's your name?

25
00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:26.411
Hana: Hana.

26
00:01:26.412 --> 00:01:28.061
Clerk: Paging Hana's mother!

27
00:01:28.062 --> 00:01:30.140
Clerk: Please come to the checkout counter.

28
00:01:30.141 --> 00:01:33.940
Hana is waiting for you.

29
00:01:33.941 --> 00:01:36.881
Mom: Hana! Hana!

30
00:01:36.882 --> 00:01:39.472
Clerk: I'm glad you found your mom, Hana.

31
00:01:39.473 --> 00:01:42.656
Hana: I was scared that I lost you!

32
00:01:42.657 --> 00:01:44.508
Mom: Hana, don't worry.

33
00:01:44.509 --> 00:01:48.111
You'll never lose me!

34
00:01:48.112 --> 00:01:51.950
Whew! That was a close call.

35
00:01:51.951 --> 00:01:55.875
I thought I would never see my mom again!

36
00:01:55.876 --> 00:02:00.891
I'm glad that clerk was so nice to help me.
